{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_026yur_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_026yur_4000_situation", "source_sha256": "89dc6029240178b98dafdf106c4da8764d5ced443d96eab7b1594f14765a8f9d", "ja": "PV撮影のお仕事", "zh": "PV拍摄工作", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_026yur_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_026yur_4000_place", "source_sha256": "2f549a5e31fe3c529f3f1cb2c891601ea53e1c6766c8ccc67e43e5870e8bfa08", "ja": "収録スタジオ", "zh": "摄影棚", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_026yur_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_026yur_4001_026yur", "source_sha256": "83c59c65b76f2dc5ede78524f2061717dce09346aead4c52878d920051a2fbcb", "ja": "あの、{$P$}さん、\n少し、お時間いいですか？", "zh": "那个，{$P$}先生，\n请问能占用你一点时间吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_026yur_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_026yur_4002_p", "source_sha256": "2fda2e597daf18f03edb11c863443c6c81c8d6e291967648e00e1a2bb27a58f6", "ja": "どうした、百合子？　真剣な顔して。", "zh": "怎么了，百合子？表情这么严肃。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_026yur_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_026yur_4003_026yur", "source_sha256": "f300e6e9d02fdab536b96b464fc43c93be0352be5cd12cbfd479e892fe111a35", "ja": "も……もうすぐ、PV撮影がありますよね。\n私がメインの……。", "zh": "马……马上就要拍摄PV了对吧。\n由我担任主角的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_026yur_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_026yur_4004_026yur", "source_sha256": "266ec8d011bd61ee9cf0f3f6657f3a73895a79e9f3f4a04ebf27dd403c1579e7", "ja": "その……ご存知とは思いますが、私、\nダンスはあまり得意ではなくてですね……。", "zh": "那个……我想你也很清楚，\n我并不是很擅长跳舞……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_026yur_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_026yur_4005_026yur", "source_sha256": "fa712d5da8dd6ce42a53b548b7033ab5cf27538aeaf251b8bf782d94b8592c78", "ja": "そんな未熟な私でも、いいPVにするためには、\n何に気をつけたらいいか……教えてください！", "zh": "为了让不成熟的我也能拍出好的PV，\n请你告诉我……我需要注意些什么！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_026yur_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_026yur_4006_p", "source_sha256": "b37f0ca06af3846b421169dc3709d5e1a126eaae3bfe1f42e039b87b629a27d7", "ja": "そうだな、気をつけるとしたら……。", "zh": "这个嘛，说到该注意的地方……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_026yur_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_026yur_4007", "source_sha256": "ebe23e29836ab5c9216f01a238517e4e4ae98f2024671d321584843b255dbfa7", "ja": "ダンスを楽しもう", "zh": "享受跳舞", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_026yur_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_026yur_4008", "source_sha256": "020d70af04b41760fe0996f1f191d77d4cadae41565864068fea5680f01f5288", "ja": "指先の動きに気を配る", "zh": "注意指尖的动作", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_026yur_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_026yur_4009", "source_sha256": "9dda7046572293e2ec9beb2a721328fb0e369ec1e0113884f0fbeb8093840258", "ja": "リズムに乗る", "zh": "跟上节奏", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_026yur_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_026yur_4100_p", "source_sha256": "b87a1b559f60a12a2cd4c12e59789a7c764c7222f840aca8f089e5f2fca239a6", "ja": "大事なのは、ダンスを楽しむことだと思う。今は\n苦手意識があって、あまり楽しめてないんじゃないか？", "zh": "我想重要的是享受跳舞。你现在觉得自己跳得不好，\n所以不怎么能乐在其中吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_026yur_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_026yur_4101_026yur", "source_sha256": "fbaed4f2cefe1787350e9192aba5eb5cb36c2f20890e0d7869e2fe7dbb644d1e", "ja": "楽しむ！？　そ、そんなことでいいんでしょうか？", "zh": "享受！？只、只要那样就可以了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_026yur_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_026yur_4102_026yur", "source_sha256": "2c7534527272fc5f37a3c2415d60a41d564908fcd7cf646c4a525df769488907", "ja": "もっと、こう、命を削って神の領域を目指すような、\nそういう努力が必要なんじゃ……！？", "zh": "不是应该不惜粉身碎骨以达到神之领域，\n付出诸如此类的努力吗……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_026yur_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_026yur_4103_p", "source_sha256": "0ef8b62eac4f47fe72dbea43a3d0802b7ee63a748b630a2cfb71c7f1961af13a", "ja": "いや、誰もそこまで言ってないけど……ファンを\n楽しませるためにも、まず自分が楽しむことが大事だ。", "zh": "不，没人说要做到那种程度……要让粉丝觉得开心，\n首先要让自己乐在其中，这点很重要。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_026yur_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_026yur_4104_026yur", "source_sha256": "0428f9250c6626473088abb9e5acd86fa1383d3850cefa7f9b6e51c29b665658", "ja": "{$P$}さん……わかりました！\n今回のPV撮影、私、世界中の誰よりも楽しみますね！", "zh": "{$P$}先生……我知道了！\n这次的PV拍摄，我会比全世界的任何人都还要更乐在其中！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_026yur_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_026yur_4105_p", "source_sha256": "eba03e5bfb49e18e0e15ef00ae63a5665db75375b5209998e6053e1692b1ee2e", "ja": "いや、だからそこまで大げさじゃなくても……\n聞いてないな……。", "zh": "不，所以我说不需要这么夸张……\n没在听啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_026yur_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_026yur_4200_p", "source_sha256": "8b3a983000187e600f6f9d4df4cb54349d6c26c446b94c04043a6d2bfba690ce", "ja": "そうだな。指先やつま先といった、細かいところにまで\n気を配ることだな。", "zh": "这个嘛，要连指尖或脚尖\n这种小地方的动作都留意。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_026yur_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_026yur_4201_026yur", "source_sha256": "e360e23b824a5d62fbca82f0c13fddcad7c581c30a2915feac0affa47c1561a4", "ja": "それって……神は細部に宿る、って話ですね！？\n美しい動きは、細心の注意と心配りから生まれる……。", "zh": "就是所谓的……上帝藏在细节里，对吧！？\n要细心谨慎，才能展现美丽的动作……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_026yur_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_026yur_4202_026yur", "source_sha256": "c5c96d90f59f80f052560b542856de6c5e9d7dbc171981e13c4acf6721756390", "ja": "わかりました！　今の私にできる、細心の注意を払って\nダンスに集中したいと思いますっ！", "zh": "我知道了！我会尽自己现在所能，\n用细心谨慎的态度，专注在舞蹈上！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_026yur_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_026yur_4300_p", "source_sha256": "3913b1f5352b8c61a117fb8d9b085267d383b7ef8e6cf9edfa4095dbf4541457", "ja": "よく音楽を聞いて、リズムに乗って体を動かす！\n簡単だろ？", "zh": "专心听音乐，跟着旋律舞动身体！\n很简单吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_026yur_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_026yur_4301_026yur", "source_sha256": "f3c64efbcf14df6265da0f4c178a4e429cbc773a1a6fe2e63e645ab57bfe618d", "ja": "そのリズムに乗って、体を動かすのが、\n私にとっては、死ぬほど難しいんですってば～っ！", "zh": "跟着旋律舞动身体，那对我来说，\n就是难得要死嘛～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_026yur_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_026yur_4302_026yur", "source_sha256": "85bf4a665add3930d315a124875b1a22ce412daa405e2b9b3f45d940f2057745", "ja": "うぅ……もう、こうなったら、やるしかないですよね。\n私の全身全霊をかけたダンス……見ててください！", "zh": "呜呜……既然这样，也只能硬着头皮上了。\n请你好好看我……用尽全心全力跳出的舞蹈吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
